    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716360/extras/6931a9859c93deab8f7dd98f9d7e701c.avif?t=1752931654\" data-has-big width=800 height=156 /></span>Inspired by the difficult controls of <i>QWOP</i>, <i>Upstairs</i> puts you in control of each calf and thigh as you attempt the seemingly simple task of walking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716360/extras/7dfaf9dbe9aa657b9842ed27d8311b2d.poster.avif?t=1752931654\" width=600 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716360/extras/7dfaf9dbe9aa657b9842ed27d8311b2d.webm?t=1752931654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716360/extras/7dfaf9dbe9aa657b9842ed27d8311b2d.mp4?t=1752931654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk solo or as a group of prisoners on a path to glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based leg controls that will do something to your confidence </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player &amp; Multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mutual tripping functionality</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Necessary ragdoll physics </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environments with an ominously vague sense of purpose</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No jump button. There's no jump button.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716360/extras/a30b69bfeeeccf1e0f13b3fd06de9bf3.poster.avif?t=1752931654\" width=600 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716360/extras/a30b69bfeeeccf1e0f13b3fd06de9bf3.webm?t=1752931654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716360/extras/a30b69bfeeeccf1e0f13b3fd06de9bf3.mp4?t=1752931654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Developer Note:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks for checking out <i>Upstairs</i>, any feedback would be greatly appreciated for future updates. Follow and DM me on X @HENRY_MEAD_</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716360/extras/6931a9859c93deab8f7dd98f9d7e701c.avif?t=1752931654\" data-has-big width=800 height=156 /></span>Inspired by the difficult controls of <i>QWOP</i>, <i>Upstairs</i> puts you in control of each calf and thigh as you attempt the seemingly simple task of walking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716360/extras/7dfaf9dbe9aa657b9842ed27d8311b2d.poster.avif?t=1752931654\" width=600 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716360/extras/7dfaf9dbe9aa657b9842ed27d8311b2d.webm?t=1752931654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716360/extras/7dfaf9dbe9aa657b9842ed27d8311b2d.mp4?t=1752931654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk solo or as a group of prisoners on a path to glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based leg controls that will do something to your confidence </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player &amp; Multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mutual tripping functionality</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Necessary ragdoll physics </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environments with an ominously vague sense of purpose</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No jump button. There's no jump button.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716360/extras/a30b69bfeeeccf1e0f13b3fd06de9bf3.poster.avif?t=1752931654\" width=600 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716360/extras/a30b69bfeeeccf1e0f13b3fd06de9bf3.webm?t=1752931654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716360/extras/a30b69bfeeeccf1e0f13b3fd06de9bf3.mp4?t=1752931654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Developer Note:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks for checking out <i>Upstairs</i>, any feedback would be greatly appreciated for future updates. Follow and DM me on X @HENRY_MEAD_</p>",
